      "Language": "ita",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The adequate treatment for acute patellar dislocation is still controversial. The Authors describe a new surgical arthroscopic technique to repair medial retinaculum rupture, which is the most common lesion in the acute patellar dislocation. Compared to arthrotomy arthroscopic treatment eliminates post-operative pain and shows the same advantages in reducing recurrences."},
